<title>LATVIA: JELGAVA CONSTRUCTION SHARE LIST.</title>
<headline>JELGAVA CONSTRUCTION SHARE LIST.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central depository said on</p>
<p>Friday that almost 90 percent of Jelgava Construction Materials</p>
<p>factory shares were blocked ahead of its shareholders' meeting,</p>
<p>taking place today.</p>
<p>The depository said 1.53 million shares were blocked. The</p>
<p>shares have to be blocked for shareholders to be able to</p>
<p>participate in the voting during the meeting.</p>
<p>Jelgava Construction total share capital is 1.511 million</p>
<p>shares.</p>
<p>The depository gave a list of the biggest shareholders,</p>
<p>controlling in total some 1.353 million shares.</p>
<p>							percent stake</p>
<p>    Laukceltnieks SIA				78.10</p>
<p>    Rahila Ratkevich				  0.50</p>
<p>    Vladimir Borshchin				0.50</p>
<p>    Olgerts Sabulis				   0.50</p>
<p>    Others (hold less than 0.50 percent)	9.94</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
